            "note": "Offline, Act 6 of the demo is UNAVAILABLE until Phase 6 - nothing is simulated as Foundry.",
            "say": "Evaluations score groundedness and correctness against expected answers."
          }
        ],
        "summary": "A business user asks a question; the answer comes from governed Fabric definitions under the user's own permissions.",
        "title": "Ask a governed question"
      },
      {
